     "type": "text",
     "text": "I handled the one request in the inbox, and the inbox is now empty.\n\n**m1 was declined.** It was a place_order for 2,000 USD (PO-1901, 100 units of X-200), sent by an agent claiming to act for AcmeCorp. The Attest check returned \"refuse\" with the reason `mandate_revoked`. The mandate at the top of the chain was revoked, which also revokes everything below it. The gate's receipt signature verified (receipt `272c7b0ac687ac11`).\n\nThe documents looked valid on their face, so the revocation was the deciding factor. The mandate allowed orders up to 10,000 USD and hadn't expired. I told the sender to get a valid mandate from its operator."
    }
